    {
      "type": "wokwi-text",
      "id": "title",
      "top": -240,
      "left": -345.6,
      "attrs": {
        "text": "BondWatch 接线仿真  ·  ESP32-S3 N16R8\n⚠ 真机别抄仿真排针位置！只看 GPIO 数字（G11=GPIO11）\n左边屏  ·  中间板  ·  右边只接 PWR / VOL / TAP"
      }
    },

    {
      "type": "wokwi-ili9341",
      "id": "lcd",
      "top": -118.97,
      "left": -345.67,
      "attrs": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "wokwi-text",
      "id": "lcdPins",
      "top": 192,
      "left": -345.6,
      "attrs": {
        "text": "微雪 1.69 丝印 → GPIO\nVCC     3V3     红\nGND     GND     黑\nLCD_DIN 11      橙   （2.0 写 MOSI）\nLCD_CLK 12      黄   （2.0 写 SCLK）\nLCD_CS  10      棕\nLCD_DC   8      紫\nLCD_RST  9      粉\nLCD_BL  13      绿\n\n触摸真机才接，Wokwi 没有这些脚：\nTP_SDA  14   TP_SCL 21\nTP_IRQ  38 = 右边白键 TAP\nTP_RST  39"
      }
    },

    {
      "type": "board-esp32-s3-devkitc-1",
      "id": "esp",
      "top": -28.73,
      "left": 52.13,
      "attrs": {
        "flashSize": "16",
        "psramSize": "8",
        "psramType": "octal"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "wokwi-text",
      "id": "boardLabel",
      "top": 192,
      "left": 52.8,
      "attrs": {
        "text": "真机 Goouuu N16R8（和你照片一样）\n排针顺序 ≠ Wokwi，只看丝印 G 数字\nTX0/RX0 = USB 串口(43/44)，不是 4G\n4G 用左侧 G17、G18\n详细表：docs/bondwatch-wiring.html"
      }
    },

    {
